1.  SCOPE AND BACKGROUND

    rolling_flash is the firmware download and upgrade service of this
    project.  It fetches firmware packages (see FwUpdate.ini under
    flash_set/) and drives the modem firmware update flow.  It is
    distributed as a prebuilt x86-64 ELF executable: the translation units
    it was built from are not published in this repository, and the
    top-level application/CMakeLists.txt compiles nothing, so nothing here
    is built from source.

    rolling_flash is therefore NOT covered by the GNU Lesser General
    Public License version 2.1 that applies to the published scripts,
    headers and packaging of this project (see the LICENSE file in the
    top-level directory, SECTION A), and it cannot be rebuilt from the
    published sources -- it does not meet the Debian Free Software
    Guidelines requirement that the preferred form for modification be
    available.

    Redistribution in binary form is granted by the copyright holder under
    this license.  The repository-level LICENSE file states the same grant
    in its SECTION B; this file is the self-contained copy that travels
    with the binary.


